  "caption_groups": [
    {
      "start": 0.852083,
      "end": 2.9614570000000002,
      "text": "The forest trees release water vapor into"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.9875,
      "end": 4.966707,
      "text": "the atmosphere through transpiration and"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.992708,
      "end": 6.763541,
      "text": "this moisture is deposited in other"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.789583,
      "end": 7.518749000000001,
      "text": "localities."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.232083,
      "end": 11.081083,
      "text": "This moisture is deposited in other"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.107083,
      "end": 13.281581999999998,
      "text": "localities in the form of precipitation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.568041,
      "end": 15.846707999999998,
      "text": "forming a virtual river across the region."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.188083,
      "end": 19.219333,
      "text": "With its large surface area and abundant"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.232374999999998,
      "end": 21.544957999999998,
      "text": "rainfall, Brazil receives more rain in a"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.550082999999997,
      "end": 23.034456999999996,
      "text": "year than any other country."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.376082999999998,
      "end": 26.550582,
      "text": "Researchers found that carbon stocks in the"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.576624999999996,
      "end": 28.868290999999996,
      "text": "Amazon region were reduced following logging"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.894332999999996,
      "end": 30.287540999999997,
      "text": "processes in the forest."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.612083,
      "end": 33.448040999999996,
      "text": "This logging demonstrates the negative"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.474083,
      "end": 35.336082,
      "text": "impact that logging has on the forest"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.362083,
      "end": 37.211082999999995,
      "text": "ability to store carbon emissions."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.536083,
      "end": 40.580374,
      "text": "Climate change seriously increases the"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.606415999999996,
      "end": 42.377249,
      "text": "likelihood of droughts in the Amazon"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.403290999999996,
      "end": 44.87725,
      "text": "rainforest, which severely hurt the forest."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.204083,
      "end": 47.987958,
      "text": "The combination of climate change and"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.013999999999996,
      "end": 50.344708,
      "text": "deforestation increases the drying effect of"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.370749999999994,
      "end": 52.388999,
      "text": "dead trees that fuels forest fires."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.72808299999999,
      "end": 56.202040999999994,
      "text": "Brazil protections of the Amazon rainforest"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.22808299999999,
      "end": 58.480707999999986,
      "text": "were slashed, resulting in a severe loss"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.50674999999999,
      "end": 59.99112499999999,
      "text": "of trees across the land."
    }
  ],
